  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41301" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved nutritional status of vulnerable and deprived communities in Sudan through large scale food fortification, home fortification, and the introduction of bio-fortified crops in rural communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve the nutritional status of vulnerable population across Sudan, and in particular women, girls and children, through increased availability, access, and consumption of fortified food, micronutrient powders and bio-fortified crops
1.	Create an enabling legislative and policy environment for food fortification in Sudan through improved governance, coordination, evidence generation and enhanced capacities for advocacy and law enforcement
2.	Support the private sector?s capacity for the production of fortified food in line with national standards, distribution of micronutrient powder, and production of bio-fortified crops
3.	Promote healthy food choices and increase the demand for fortified food, micronutrient powder, nutrient-rich crops and biofortified varieties of crops</narrative>
  </description>
